From ee08cb17fa47922bb5ab9d2cdf3a13f155add60f Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: qwolff <ada@example.org>
Date: Thu, 15 Oct 2026 01:09:37 -0700
Subject: [PATCH] fix(selection): drain pending X11 conversions before Wayland
 takeover

Keep the original X11 selection, pipes, FIFO and event routing until all already accepted conversions complete. Defer only X11 ownership acquisition, not the compositor's mirror adoption, so queued conversions cannot read the next selection's bytes. Drop deferred offers on real replacement or revocation; observe null clipboard revocation through the SCTK proxy lifetime as well as selection callbacks.
